"CN_Complete_Patch"
{
    "id"    "CN_Complete_Patch"
    "type"  "mod"
    "title" "CN Complete Patch 汉化补全补丁 (B42.20)"
    "description"
    "
Community-made simplified Chinese completion patch for Project Zomboid Build 42.20.

Covers 388 item-name translations missing from the three major CN packs (B42Trans_CN / B42ModTrans_CN / GardeniaTranslate_CN):

- ModernFirearmsSystem (221): firearms, mags, ammo boxes, reloading gear
- FantasyWorkshop VS42 4.0 (96): outfits, bags, chest rigs
- VanillaFoodsExpanded (24): foods, containers
- 42_VSGirlBodySFW (15), damnlib (23), and 10 more mods

[b]Load Order[/b]
Place AFTER all translation packs, at the end of your Mods list:
...Spawn Location_CN;GardeniaTranslate_CN;B42ModTrans_CN;B42Trans_CN;CN_Complete_Patch

[b]Format[/b]
Standard B42 JSON translations (media/lua/shared/Translate/CN/ItemName.json, keys = Module.Item). No script overrides, safe with any mod list.

[b]Source[/b]
GitHub: see CN_Complete_Patch repository (translation source tables included).

[b]更新说明[/b]
简体中文补全补丁：补齐三大汉化包未收录的模组物品名，共 388 条（现代火器系统/幻想工坊/原版食物扩展等 15 个模组）。请放在所有汉化包之后加载。
    "
